# Consumer keep rules for :feature:scan, applied to the app's R8 run.

# ML Kit's MlKitComponentDiscoveryService reads each registrar's class name from manifest meta-data and
# instantiates it reflectively through the no-arg constructor. The registrars carry no @UsedBy annotation, so
# ML Kit's shipped rule misses them and R8 strips the constructor: init fails with a NoSuchMethodException
# and the barcode scanner never initialises.
-keepclassmembers class * implements com.google.firebase.components.ComponentRegistrar { <init>(); }
